<title>USA: Vertex files for 2.5 mln common offer.</title>
<headline>Vertex files for 2.5 mln common offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vertex Pharmaceuticals Inc filed Tuesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to 2.5 million common shares.</p>
